### libheif 1.23.5 (statically linked into `Morph.exe` and `morph-cli.exe`)

- HEIC/HEIF and AVIF decoding. License: **LGPL-3.0**. Text: `licenses\libheif\`.
- Source: https://github.com/strukturag/libheif/tree/v1.23.5
  (built with vcpkg, port at https://github.com/microsoft/vcpkg/tree/43556691564c77399737293f554294710dfc36c0/ports/libheif).

### libde265 1.1.3 (statically linked)

- HEVC decoder used by libheif. License: **LGPL-3.0**. Text: `licenses\libde265\`.
- Source: https://github.com/strukturag/libde265/tree/v1.1.3
  (vcpkg port at https://github.com/microsoft/vcpkg/tree/a31205ef9f1924eb95168efd8df89dc01e585269/ports/libde265).

### libaom 3.15.2 (statically linked)

- AV1 decoder used by libheif for AVIF. License: BSD-2-Clause plus the
  Alliance for Open Media Patent License 1.0. Text: `licenses\aom\`.
- Source: https://aomedia.googlesource.com/aom/+/af3dc9aadc793c1b00edc003e3fc19a44fdeb574

### libwebp 1.3.1 (statically linked, built by the `libwebp-sys` crate)

- WebP encoding. License: BSD-3-Clause plus the WebM additional IP rights grant.
  Text: `licenses\libwebp\`. Source: https://chromium.googlesource.com/webm/libwebp

### mozjpeg (statically linked, built by the `mozjpeg-sys` crate)

- JPEG encoding. License: IJG, BSD-3-Clause and Zlib. Text: `licenses\mozjpeg\`.
  Source: https://github.com/mozilla/mozjpeg
- This software is based in part on the work of the Independent JPEG Group.

### libdeflate 1.26 (statically linked, built by the `libdeflate-sys` crate)

- Used for PNG optimization. License: MIT. Text: `licenses\libdeflate\`.
  Source: https://github.com/ebiggers/libdeflate

### Slint 1.18.1 (user interface toolkit)

- Used under **GPL-3.0-only**, one of Slint's three license options. Text: `licenses\slint\`.
  Source: https://github.com/slint-ui/slint/tree/v1.18.1

### Feather icons (vector icons drawn in the Morph windows)

- Most of the line icons in `crates/morph-app/ui/icons/` come from Feather, https://feathericons.com
